{"ts":"2026-07-30T12:59:53.705Z","type":"quest-declared","sealed":{"doneWhen":{"probe":"scenario-harness","args":{"scenario":"parallel-evidence-machine-mutex","consecutive":3,"metric":"priority"}},"frontierMetrics":[{"probe":"scenario-harness","args":{"scenario":"parallel-evidence-machine-mutex","metric":"priority"}}],"authoringContractVersion":1,"statement":"Every live scenario or benchmark run across all worktrees of this repository serializes through the shared machine evidence lock: two concurrent evidence-bearing runs cannot both proceed, a crashed or rebooted holder is stolen with a printed notice rather than deadlocking, and the durable capacity evidence produced under the lock is attributable to a single uncontended run.","title":null,"class":"process","constraints":[{"id":"source-change-subagent-verification","statement":"If this Quest changes source code, spawn a subagent verifier before audit and git handoff, then record a Solver finding with evidence subagent:<id>."},{"id":"shared-common-dir-lock","statement":"The lock lives under the git common dir (all worktrees resolve one path) and acquisition is a single atomic mkdir; no lock path may depend on which worktree acquires."},{"id":"stale-steal-never-silent","statement":"A lock whose owner pid is dead or whose recorded worktree no longer exists is stolen with a printed notice; the mkdir-to-owner-write window is treated as LIVE and never stolen."},{"id":"bypass-is-loud","statement":"LAGRANGE_EVIDENCE_LOCK_BYPASS runs without the lock but prints a corruption warning into the run's own output, so bypassed evidence is attributable in any later audit."},{"id":"wrapper-adoption-not-rewrite","statement":"Live runners adopt the lock via the `with -- <cmd>` wrapper or an explicit acquire/release pair when touched; this Quest does not rewrite every existing scripts/checks live runner."},{"id":"deterministic-runs-unlocked","statement":"Deterministic in-process tests never take the machine lock; only live/benchmark evidence-bearing runs serialize."}],"verificationTemplates":["concurrency-serialization","recovery-replay"],"frontierIds":["parallel-evidence-machine-mutex-main"]}}
